  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Accountable, Effective and People-centered Policing in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of police reforms in Kenya since 2010 has been to transform the National Police Service (NPS) into an efficient, effective, professional and accountable institution that is trusted by and responsive to the safety and security needs of the people of Kenya. Effective policing is integral to realizing Kenya&#x2019;s Vision 2030, which emphasizes security, peace and rule of law for economic growth and social stability</narrative>
  </description>
